              "items": [
                {
                  "category": null,
                  "details": [
                    "Heads Up: \nFocus the students’ attention on the CPT and present relevant features of the language (MFP). Then demonstrate the activity with TA/students.\nHeads Down: \nSs open their books. Instruct and ask ICQs. Then monitor, providing support and stretch where needed. Conduct activity feedback and error correction.\nHeads Together: \nDemo/Instruct and ask ICQs, including setting behaviour expectations. Then monitor, providing support and stretch where needed. Conduct activity feedback and error correction.\nReward moment\nCheck behaviour expectations and reward with APOS or remind for 4Rs"
